  "name": "Unarmored Movement",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-banded-steel-grey.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 2nd level, your speed increases by 10 feet while you are not wearing armor or wielding a shield. This bonus increases when you reach certain brawler levels, as shown in the Brawler table.</p>\n<p>Additionally, as a bonus action, you can take the Disengage or Dash action, and your jump distance is doubled for the turn.</p>\n<p>At 9th level, you gain the ability to move along vertical surfaces and across liquids on your turn without falling during the move.</p>",
